{
  "id": "507",
  "title": "Help Me Make an Appointment",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-04-29",
  "synopsis": "Manager Wang asks Little Zhang to schedule a new time for a meeting.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/713/7c944274ffcce64d4a79fa5430f2291c74528031.mp3?1698351351",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你帮我约个时间吧\n\n王总：小张，你帮我打电话给长城公司的陈总，另约一个见面的时间。我现在有急事，需要去天津，今天赶不回来了。\n小张：好的。改成什么时候见面比较好呢？\n王总：我看一下。我周二的上午、周四和周五全天都可以。\n小张：王总，周五上午我们有个部门会议。\n王总：那就剩下的其他时间，你帮我约个时间吧。\n小张：好的。",
    "traditional": "你幫我約個時間吧\n\n王總：小張，你幫我打電話給長城公司的陳總，另約一個見面的時間。我現在有急事，需要去天津，今天趕不回來了。\n小張：好的。改成什麼時候見面比較好呢？\n王總：我看一下。我週二的上午、週四和週五全天都可以。\n小張：王總，週五上午我們有個部門會議。\n王總：那就剩下的其他時間，你幫我約個時間吧。\n小張：好的。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Help me make an appointment"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "王总：小张，你帮我打电话给长城公司的陈总，",
      "traditional": "王總：小張，你幫我打電話給長城公司的陳總，",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng xiǎo zhāng nǐ bāng wǒ dǎ diàn huà gěi cháng chéng gōng sī de chén zǒng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "另约一个见面的时间。",
      "traditional": "另約一個見面的時間。",
      "pinyin": "lìng yuē yí ge jiàn miàn de shí jiān",
      "english": "Manager Wang: Little Zhang, help me make a phone call to the Great Wall Company's manager Chen .."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "我现在有急事，需要去天津，今天赶不回来了。",
      "traditional": "我現在有急事，需要去天津，今天趕不回來了。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xiàn zài yǒu jí shì xū yào qù tiān jīn jīn tiān gǎn bù huí lái le",
      "english": ".. to book a new time for meeting."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "At the moment I have an urgent matter and have to go to Tianjin. I won't make it back today."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小张：好的。改成什么时候见面比较好呢？",
      "traditional": "小張：好的。改成什麼時候見面比較好呢？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng hǎo de gǎi chéng shén me shí hou jiàn miàn bǐ jiào hǎo ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Ok. What should I change the meeting time to?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "王总：我看一下。我周二的上午、周四和周五全天都可以。",
      "traditional": "王總：我看一下。我週二的上午、週四和週五全天都可以。",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng wǒ kàn yí xià wǒ zhōu èr de shàng wǔ zhōu sì hé zhōu wǔ quán tiān dōu kě yǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: Let me have a look. I'm available on Tuesday morning and the entire Thursday and Friday."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小张：王总，周五上午我们有个部门会议。",
      "traditional": "小張：王總，週五上午我們有個部門會議。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng wáng zǒng zhōu wǔ shàng wǔ wǒ men yǒu ge bù mén huì yì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Manager Wang, on Friday morning we have department meeting."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "王总：那就剩下的其他时间，你帮我约个时间吧。",
      "traditional": "王總：那就剩下的其他時間，你幫我約個時間吧。",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng nà jiù shèng xià de qí tā shí jiān nǐ bāng wǒ yuē ge shí jiān ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: Then just the remaining time slots. Help me book a time."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小张：好的。",
      "traditional": "小張：好的。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Ok."
    }
  ],
