    "sentence_translations": [
      "Help me make an appointment",
      "",
      "Manager Wang: Little Zhang, help me make a phone call to the Great Wall Company's manager Chen ..",
      ".. to book a new time for meeting.",
      "At the moment I have an urgent matter and have to go to Tianjin. I won't make it back today.",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: Ok. What should I change the meeting time to?",
      "",
      "Manager Wang: Let me have a look. I'm available on Tuesday morning and the entire Thursday and Friday.",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: Manager Wang, on Friday morning we have department meeting.",
      "",
      "Manager Wang: Then just the remaining time slots. Help me book a time.",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: Ok.",
      ""
